Knowing he didn\rquote t have much of a sweet tooth, Layla was a little taken aback, but she quickly grasped that he was suggesting it because he knew she liked it.\par
They walked to the town square and got an outdoor table at a cafe. Soon the server placed a bowl of vanilla ice cream in front of Layla, and a cold glass of beer in front of Bill.\par
\ldblquote Better hurry up and eat that or it\rquote s going to melt, kiddo,\rdblquote  he said, chuckling, as he watched her stare blankly at her ice cream.\par
