\par
\ldblquote No, it\rquote s nothing like that, Uncle Bill,\rdblquote  she replied, shaking her head. She then quickly scooped up a big spoonful of ice cream and put it in her mouth. \ldblquote It\rquote s so good!\rdblquote  she exclaimed, smiling brightly. She ate another spoonful, and then another, until she had finished the bowl. Keeping her eyes wide open, she looked up at the clear blue, summer sky. It would soon be summer in the beautiful, distant city to the north, as well.\par
