The higher-ranking, middle-aged maid standing next to Lady and Dowager Herhardt made eye contact with the younger maid, and then glanced at the door. The younger maid took the hint at once and hurried out of the room. The older maid then left as well, leaving Elise and Katharina alone in the quiet drawing room.\par
