Sure, it was just a brief deviation from the norm, Katharina thought.\par
With that problem out of the way, they could focus all their attention on the fast-approaching wedding. They had noticed that Matthias was looking a little gaunt, but they had chalked this up to him being busy wrapping up loose ends with the family business so that he and Claudine could have a long, peaceful honeymoon together.\par
\ldblquote You don\rquote t think it\rquote s because of Layla, do you?\rdblquote  Elise asked.\par
\ldblquote Come now, Elise, there\rquote s no way,\rdblquote  Katharina replied in a cold tone of voice. \ldblquote I\rquote m sure he\rquote s just a little worn out from overwork. He\rquote ll be fine once he gets some rest.\rdblquote\par
