The early-summer sky looked peaceful as Matthias lay floating on the water, gazing up at it. Now and then he saw a cloud drifting along or some birds flying by. The river\rquote s water was a dreamlike shade of blue. The sound and\par
\par
texture of the water was also dreamlike, as was the feeling of his own existence.\par
