He was out of pills, but he had to sleep. Thus he only had one option left: tormenting his own body with physical exertion. Over the previous few days, he had discovered that exercising to the point of exhaustion was just as effective as sleeping pills.\par
\ldblquote I\rquote m afraid this behavior is not good for your long-term health, Your Grace, \rdblquote  Dr. Ettman had said during his house call the previous evening, looking at Matthias as if he were gazing at the most pitiful person in the world.\par
