\par
Your Grace. I\rquote m worried that sleep has become an escape for you. That\rquote s not healthy. Now, I want to help you. I hope that is clear. But even the best doctor can\rquote t help a patient who doesn\rquote t want to get better. And you can only get better by finding the true source of your problems and tackling it head-on.\rdblquote\par
