Thinking back on this now, Matthias grinned faintly and shook his head. He knew he wasn\rquote t likely to be able to find another doctor better than Dr. Ettman. No matter who else Dr. Ettman dragged in as a replacement, nothing would change. Unless the person he brought was Layla herself. Or God.\par
