As the doctor\rquote s long-winded lecture dragged on, Matthias thought back to the beautiful hallucinations in which he had just been immersed.\par
That day, when we gazed into each other\rquote s eyes for so long as we lay in bed, she seemed enraptured by the sight of me. Was she putting on an act even then?\par
