Of course. It\rquote s so simple.\par
Suddenly he felt excitement surging up inside him, as if he had just found a light at the end of the tunnel.\par
If I\rquote ve really lost her forever\'85 If I can really n ever get her back\'85 then I should just kill her instead.\par
