Matthias looked down at him. There was no expression on his face, which was splattered with the blood of the man he had just killed. When the smoke had cleared from the barrel of his gun, he put it back in its holster, and then looked at the general again. Several of the other soldiers gulped nervously.\par
\ldblquote This battle is over,\rdblquote  Matthias said, repeating his earlier statement exactly. He extended his hand towards the frightened-looking general, as if he wanted to shake his hand.\par
