After gently setting the fork down on the table, he walked up to her. She raised the knife, as if she was really going to stab him.\par
\par
\ldblquote My pistol is right over there, after all,\rdblquote  he said, looking with mock pity at the bedside table, where he had left his holster with his pistol in it. \ldblquote And yet you picked that weapon instead? If only you\rquote d been as resourceful as you are passionate.\rdblquote\par
