Her face went blank as she looked at him. The man standing in front of her didn\rquote t seem like the Matthias von Herhardt she knew. That was one thing of which she was certain, no matter how confusing everything else was.\par
\ldblquote You killed that fool, Layla.\rdblquote  The smile vanished from his face and was replaced by utter coldness.\par
