pressing her back against the window frame. As she did so, the knife dropped from her loose, trembling hand, falling onto the carpet.\par
\ldblquote I\rquote ll let you know what I want once I decide on it,\rdblquote  he replied, snickering. \ldblquote Until then, eat.\rdblquote  Acting like a gentleman escorting a lady, he then led her to the table and sat her down. \ldblquote You need to feed my baby, after all.\rdblquote\par
As he looked down at her round belly, she flinched uncomfortably, as if there were a bug crawling on her.\par
\ldblquote I told you, it\rquote s not your baby.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote I fully understand and respect your wish for me to kill you, but I won\rquote t be able to grant it until the baby has made it safely out of you.\rdblquote  After looking down at the knife on the floor and shaking his head, he lifted his own knife\par
\par
and cut up the steak on her plate. \ldblquote Looking at you right now, I\rquote m unsure whether even that will be possible. So eat up.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote I\rquote m sorry, but my stomach is incapable of taking in food when someone like you is nearby,\rdblquote  she replied, remaining obstinate even as she felt like crying. He chuckled at her behavior. She reminded him of an ill-behaved puppy.\par
He didn\rquote t mind it. He was glad that she didn\rquote t realize how much he enjoyed this side of her personality. If she were aware of the way it made him feel, she would have stopped the behavior at once.\par
\ldblquote Fine, keep up the act, then,\rdblquote  he said.You\rquote re a great actress, Layla.\rdblquote  He took a sip of water and cocked his head as he looked at her. \ldblquote Just remarkable. Your eyes, your smile, even the way you behave like a cat in heat. It\rquote s truly a flawless performance.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Stop it!\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote It\rquote s a compliment, Layla. Anyway, your virtuosic acting is the reason that little surprise is growing inside of you. In other words, your acting skills saved your life.\rdblquote\par
