Bill Remmer... ? Matthias\rquote s eyes twitched briefly when he heard her mention Bill\rquote s name, but he quickly regained his composure.\par
Just then, she bolted up out of her chair. It wasn\rquote t hard to guess what she was intending to do. She took a deep breath, and then yanked the tablecloth off the table, causing all the food and dishes to fall to the floor. While the sound of\par
\par
broken dishes and clattering utensils echoed through the room, the two of them stared silently at each other.\par
