The icy silence of the room was then filled with the sound of him walking to the door and unfastening the chains on it. That was soon followed by the sound of the door opening and closing again, and then the chains on the outside of the door being fastened and locked.\par
Layla, who had been standing with her fists tightly clenched, then collapsed back into her chair.\par
The warm afternoon sunlight shone on her and the mess that she had been left alone in. Bothered by the way the sunlight was glittering in the fragments of the dishes on the floor, she closed her eyes.\par
