Her hands started to tremble as she looked back and forth between the slice of cake she was holding and the sleeping duke. Her breath quickened, and her heart started pounding. A faint moan escaped her lips as she reflexively stepped back. Before she knew it, she had dropped the cake slice, and it had gotten on her clothes. She tried to clean herself up, but this only made it worse. By the time she came to her senses, her hair, hands, and even her shoes were smeared with cake.\par
She shook her head in distress, then quickly wiped her hands on the hem of her skirt and started searching all the pockets of his overcoat and uniform jacket. She knew it was pointless to do this, but she still wanted to. She wanted to get out of the room, even though she knew she would almost certainly get caught again.\par
