Layla remained silent for a long while. Showing neither joy nor shock, she just calmly read the document, occasionally nodding her head.\par
\ldblquote Layla?\rdblquote  Kyle said, suddenly worrying that her condition had worsened again.\par
Fortunately, this seemed not to be the case. \ldblquote What about him?\rdblquote  she calmly asked.\par
\ldblquote The duke? He\rquote s gone away.\rdblquote  \ldblquote Gone away\'85?\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Yeah. He went to deliver some news to the crown prince\rquote s unit in the rear.\par
He\rquote ll be gone for about four days.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Four days\'85?\rdblquote  she replied, parroting his words like a small child just learning to speak.\par
