Layla stood in front of the window, gazing outside. Suddenly, she sensed someone standing behind her. Startled, she turned around. It was Kyle.\par
\ldblquote Are you done packing?\rdblquote  he asked, smiling cheerfully. He had decided not to over analyze the fact that she had been spending every spare moment since the duke had left staring pensively out the window. \ldblquote Let\rquote s go, Layla. I know it\rquote s\par
\par
probably still uncomfortable for you to move around, but the place where you\rquote ll be staying isn\rquote t far from here, so-\rdblquote\par
