\ldblquote Step aside, please.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote I\rquote m not trying to defend Matthias, Miss Llewellyn. He\rquote s wildly capricious. I\rquote m sure you\rquote re quite fed up with him. Trust me, I understand how you feel. But\'85\rdblquote  Riette let out a deep sigh, putting his hand to his forehead.\par
With clear eyes, Layla looked over Kyle\rquote s shoulder at him.\par
\par
\ldblquote But Miss Llewellyn, still\'85 he\rquote s come all this way.\rdblquote  \ldblquote Marquess!\rdblquote  Kyle grumbled.\par
\ldblquote He canceled his wedding and volunteered for a dangerous assignment in the war, all so that he could come here to find you.\rdblquote  Riette clutched his hair as if he was going to rip it out.\par
Layla\rquote s eyes grew focused as she looked at him. She looked very perplexed by what she was hearing. \ldblquote What\'85 are you talking about?\rdblquote  she asked.\par
