Riette now looked as perplexed as Layla. He couldn\rquote t understand why the duke would have thrown everything away in pursuit of this woman, without telling her that he had done so.\par
\ldblquote Layla and Duke Herhardt no longer have anything to do with each other,\rdblquote  Kyle said in a cold tone. \ldblquote Don\rquote t be swayed, Layla. The fact that the duke didn\rquote t get married doesn\rquote t change anything. He\rquote s still the same Matthias von Herhardt as ever.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Kyle\'85\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote If this is about the baby, that\rquote s all the more reason for you to escape the duke. He could never be a good father.\rdblquote\par
At the mention of the baby, Layla\rquote s trembling eyes became still. She looked down at her round belly. She knew that the duke\rquote s feelings for her and the baby were anything but normal. Perhaps he was aware of this too, and that was why he had arranged to have her sent away like this.\par
\ldblquote Miss Llewellyn?\rdblquote  Riette said in a pleading tone as he tried to approach her.\par
